Show Gluon in Steam's UI and leave CrossOver's settings out.

The Windows-only hint names Gluon. The CrossOver options panel renders nothing,
since Gluon's launcher reads none of the CrossOver settings it writes. NotProton's
1.0.x launch-option migration is dropped: Gluon never wrote those options.

